    "title": "Haymakers Place Second at Home Cross Country Invite - NewsBreak",
    "text": "cozadlocal.com\nwebsite\nCozad\nHaymakers Place Second at Home Cross Country Invite\nBy Liz Romero,\n7 hours agoThe Cozad Haymakers cross country team hosted their home invite at the Cozad Country Club on Sept. 4, competing against Holdrege, Ogallala, Broken Bow, South Loup, and Kearney. Both the boys and girls squads earned runner-up finishes, with the boys scoring 37 points and the girls 39. Holdrege claimed the boys title with 14 points, while Broken Bow won the girls division with 16.",
